Subject: [PATCH] Add FPDFPageObj_GetRenderedFillPattern() API

This is similar to http://pdfium-review.googlesource.com/c/154910, but
that one was for stroke patterns and this is for fill patterns.

Change-Id: I9929e232472fdd974009c64bcb1109d69a813d0a
Reviewed-on: https://pdfium-review.googlesource.com/c/pdfium/+/157490
Commit-Queue: Lei Zhang <thestig@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Tom Sepez <tsepez@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Lei Zhang <thestig@chromium.org>
---
 fpdfsdk/fpdf_edit_embeddertest.cpp            |  64 ++++++++++++++
 fpdfsdk/fpdf_editpage.cpp                     |  79 +++++++++++-------
 fpdfsdk/fpdf_view_c_api_test.c                |   1 +
 public/fpdf_edit.h                            |  16 ++++
 .../resources/embedder_tests/pattern_fill.png | Bin 0 -> 107 bytes
 .../embedder_tests/pattern_fill_uncolored.png | Bin 0 -> 107 bytes
